---
import EcosystemLayout from '../layouts/EcosystemLayout.astro'
---

<EcosystemLayout
  title="About Siryus Creative Media Ltd"
  description="Siryus Creative Media Ltd is the parent company connecting SIRYUS A.M, ARC. Creatives, PAVO, and SIGNAL."
  canonical="https://www.siryushub.com/about"
>
  <main class="parent-page">
    <section class="parent-page__hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <h1 id="about-title">One company.<br />Four focused brands.</h1>
      <p>
        Siryus Creative Media Ltd gives each part of its creative work a clear home. The parent company connects the
        ecosystem while each brand serves its own audience.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="parent-page__section" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-title">
      <div>
        <h2 id="ecosystem-title">How the ecosystem fits together</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="parent-page__stack">
        <article>
          <h3>SIRYUS A.M</h3>
          <p>Artist management and development. Its current managed roster is Max Prodigy and Jlinez.</p>
          <a href="/siryus-am">Explore SIRYUS A.M</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>ARC. Creatives</h3>
          <p>A faith-rooted creative community with its own editorial voice and experience.</p>
          <a href="/arc">Visit ARC. Creatives</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>PAVO</h3>
          <p>A separate creative product with its own website and product experience.</p>
          <a href="https://pavocreate.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit PAVO <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>SIGNAL.</h3>
          <p>Its direction, destination, and content model are still being decided.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="parent-page__closing" aria-labelledby="company-title">
      <h2 id="company-title">A clear front door</h2>
      <p>
        This site stays small on purpose. It helps people find the right brand, then lets that brand tell its own story.
      </p>
      <a class="parent-page__primary-link" href="/contact">Contact Siryus Creative Media Ltd</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</EcosystemLayout>
